  "app.voiceSettings.port.explain": "Moving a number is not something a button can finish. Your old provider needs paperwork and account details from you, and it takes two to four weeks on their schedule. Somebody here has to action it with them, and we'll contact you about what they need.",
  "app.voiceSettings.port.estimate": "Best estimate: {date}.",
